cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TC-ResiCache: Transformation-Consistent Caching for Compute Reuse in Deep Network Training"
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "K C"
    given-names: "Sanjeeb"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kcsanjeeb/tc-resicache"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and reproducibility artifact for TC-ResiCache,
  a compute-reuse method for deep network training with two gating regimes:
  TC-SI (sample-index cache gate, fine-tuning) and TC-CR (transformation-
  consistent residual caching gate, full training). Ships the training
  scripts, baseline reimplementations, probes, runners, and the reference
  result logs (JSONL/CSV) behind the thesis experiments.
keywords:
  - deep learning
  - compute reuse
  - layer freezing
  - activation caching
  - efficient training
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-30"
